    "description": "To merge is the action of combining two things into one. There are usually two meaning associated with PHP code: \n\n+ Merging arrays, with the eponymous function ``array_merge()``, or the ``+`` operator\n+ Code merge, using a VCS, such as git, svn, etc.",
